    lead: 'A free <strong>training program rollout plan template</strong> for L&amp;D teams that runs a program from needs analysis to results — training needs assessment, instructional design, content development, a pilot, the full rollout, and evaluation. Download for Excel, PowerPoint or CSV, or open it online to link dependencies and see the critical path to your go-live.',
