    lead: 'A free <strong>webinar plan template</strong> that runs a webinar from idea to follow-up — topic and speakers, the registration page and promotion, rehearsal, the live event, and the follow-up that turns attendees into leads. Download for Excel, PowerPoint or CSV, or open it online to link dependencies and see the critical path to your event date.',
